      "text": "Pat Helland - It's ALL outside, you can't trust it, etc.\n    - outside data should be immutable and versioned.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pat Helland - It's ALL outside, you can't trust it, etc.\n    - outside data should be immutable and versioned.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
